{"about_the_game":"Lose yourself in the most immersive virtual rendition of the world\u2019s most beloved classic: Chess! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhether you\u2019re using advanced VR technology (HTC Vive, Oculus Rift etc.) or just playing on a standard computer, users of both interfaces from around the world can now challenge each other in real time. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFrom intelligent and challenging AI opponents to beginner-level bots, anyone can find an AI difficulty setting to match their own skill level. Thanks to our implementation of an advanced Opening Book program, AI competitors are now optimized to play naturally and fluidly like real human counterparts! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nImmersion Chess follows all of the official chess rules and provides optional alternative background settings for an even more engaging experience!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"eed1fe2bd0cf3e4ef7f2903cb7e31e7ad5ac83b4.jpg","localized_name":"Warm-Up","name":"Warm-Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/631660/eed1fe2bd0cf3e4ef7f2903cb7e31e7ad5ac83b4.jpg"},{"icon":"a60b49e90365c0eea87da6b85605801699a2f4c3.jpg","localized_name":"Walker","name":"Walker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/631660/a60b49e90365c0eea87da6b85605801699a2f4c3.jpg"},{"icon":"990eff80ad10e9c5c2f4532ee4a93dab2d7b19bd.jpg","localized_name":"Wanderer","name":"Wanderer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/631660/990eff80ad10e9c5c2f4532ee4a93dab2d7b19bd.jpg"},{"icon":"b6d1a097dc5e14b091a48d631423b616b59324dc.jpg","localized_name":"Brave Pawn","name":"Brave Pawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/631660/b6d1a097dc5e14b091a48d631423b616b59324dc.jpg"},{"icon":"fa7597dfe36ab8c04e78703dfbf85c40194d73e5.jpg","localized_name":"En Passant","name":"En Passant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/631660/fa7597dfe36ab